# demo: in-repo
# demo: config
Output gifs/tui-browse.gif
Output text/tui-browse.txt
Set Height 720
Source tapes/_common.tape
Source tapes/_start.tape
Hide
Type "cd ~/setlist-service && clear"
Enter
Show
Type "bam"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Type "jj"
Sleep 800ms
Type "k"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Type "t"
Sleep 2.5s
Escape
Sleep 800ms
Type "?"
Sleep 2.5s
Escape
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
